        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Lake Elkhorn, Columbia, Maryland, Owen Brown, Howard County, Baltimore metropolitan area\n- Features: reservoir, dam, park, picnic pavilion, walking path\n- People: Jason Williams\n\nFacts:\n- Columbia, Maryland, is a census-designated place in Howard County, Maryland, United States, and is one of the principal cities of the Baltimore metropolitan area.\n- Lake Elkhorn is a 37-acre reservoir in the Owen Brown area of Columbia, Maryland.\n- Lake Elkhorn has a small dam and a park with a picnic pavilion and a two-mile (3 km) walking path around the lake.\n- Jason Williams is from Columbia, Maryland.",
